strongswan-pkcs11: PQC-enabled strongSwan PKCS#11 plugin
=========================================================

This folder is derived from the pkcs11 plugin of strongSwan
(src/libstrongswan/plugins/pkcs11/ in the strongSwan source,
https://www.strongswan.org/, https://github.com/strongswan/strongswan).
The comparison baseline is the strongSwan 6.0.5 release tarball,
https://download.strongswan.org/strongswan-6.0.5.tar.bz2
(SHA-256 437460893655d6cfbc2def79d2da548cb5175b865520c507201ab2ec2e7895d9).

